Package: nanomodamp
Type: Package
Title: Counting, Merging and Site Calling for Nano-BID-Amp Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Becca", "Rodell", email = "rodell@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Per-site base, deletion and insertion counts from amplicon BAMs
    (ported from the PUS7regulation2026 Figure 2/3 counting code), name-based
    merging of per-sample count tables, and background deletion QC. Used by the
    NanoModAmp Nextflow pipeline through the CLIs in bin/.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    data.table,
    GenomicRanges,
    IRanges,
    Rsamtools,
    Biostrings,
    S4Vectors,
    GenomeInfoDb,
    future,
    future.apply,
    ggplot2,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
